%% user-fermize
%% Summary: Read one complex build decision read-only, tie the release promise to its checks and gaps, and advise on a smaller useful milestone when one is supported.
%% Sources: skills/user-fermize/core.md
%% Not shown: the Relevance, Evidence and Control lenses in detail, costly-check rerun rules, failed-gate readings, and the report's wording rules
%% Alt: A plan and one decision are read read-only in about ten minutes; each promise is tied to its condition, check and gap; a smaller milestone is shown only when supported; the result is short advice.

flowchart TD
    A[Take the plan, the decision and the intended outcome] --> B{Target and outcome clear?}
    B -- No, ask one question --> A
    B -- Yes --> C[Read instructions, plan and deciding evidence, read-only]
    C --> D[Tie each promise to its condition, check and gap]
    D --> E{Smaller useful milestone supported?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Show what it delivers, what waits, what stays unproven]
    E -- No --> G[Keep the current scope and name the gaps]
    F --> H[Return short advice-only view and the next decision]
    G --> H
